NAME
    gcloud beta kms kaj-enrollment - retrieve KAJ enrollment configs

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud beta kms kaj-enrollment COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    (BETA) The gcloud beta kms kaj-enrollment group lets you retrieve the
    enrollment configurations of Key Access Justifications(KAJ).

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     show-effective-config
        (BETA) Gets the effective KAJ enrollment config for a given project.

NOTES
    This command is currently in beta and might change without notice. This
    variant is also available:

        $ gcloud alpha kms kaj-enrollment

